## Common Mistakes to Avoid

❌ **Don't use unpadded version numbers** in filenames
❌ **Don't forget to update** main CHANGELOG.md
❌ **Don't use vague descriptions** - be specific with file names and counts
❌ **Don't add external links** - they break over time (internal file refs are OK)
❌ **Don't add excessive code samples** - brief examples OK, full implementations belong in docs
❌ **Don't add deployment procedures** - standard process doesn't need repeating
❌ **Don't be too brief** - include enough technical detail to understand scope

